    "text": "Boone Country Connection\nwebsite\nWarrenton\nSignal Work Scheduled On MO 47 in Warrenton Week Of Sept. 15\n17 hours ago\nWeather permitting, the week of September 15, contractor crews will begin work to relocate the cabinet for a signal light in Warren County at the intersection of Missouri Route 47 and the eastbound off-ramp of Interstate 70 in Warrenton. Work will include removing the existing signal cabinet currently located on...",
